    "passive": {
      "name": {
        "en": "Sugar Charge"
      },
      "desc": {
        "en": "Ellie generates Snacks upon performing certain attacks. The generated Snacks remain on the ground, and after a set time, they slowly travel towards the current teammate in use. / Snack: Approaching a Snack allows you to collect it. Upon collection, it restores a small amount of that character's HP and grants Ellie a Neutralization DMG Boost effect and 1 stack of Sugar Charge. / Sugar Charge: Sugar Charge can stack up to 3 times. At max stacks, holding the Basic Attack button will deal Pillow Pow! and consume all stacks. If Ellie is Sleepy..., Pillow Pow! is automatically triggered upon reaching 3 stacks. / Sleepy...: Switching to another character during combat will make Ellie Sleepy... for a set duration, and she will travel slowly to the enemy and generate Snacks. Using Pillow Pow! when Ellie is Sleepy... will increase the duration of Sleepy..."
      },
